---
description: "Tailwind + shadcn/ui + Radix UI standards (frontend/)."
globs: "frontend/src/components/**/*.ts,frontend/src/components/**/*.tsx,frontend/src/components/**/*.js,frontend/src/components/**/*.jsx,frontend/src/features/**/*.ts,frontend/src/features/**/*.tsx,frontend/src/features/**/*.js,frontend/src/features/**/*.jsx,frontend/src/pages/**/*.ts,frontend/src/pages/**/*.tsx,frontend/src/pages/**/*.js,frontend/src/pages/**/*.jsx"
alwaysApply: false
---

UI rules:
- Use Tailwind utility classes only.
- Prefer shadcn/ui components (Button, Card, Input, Dialog, DropdownMenu, Tabs, Table).
- Use Radix via shadcn for accessibility and behavior.
- Maintain consistent spacing (8px rhythm): gap-2/4/6/8, p-4/6/8.
- Keep visuals readable over flashy.

Glassmorphism theme rules:
- Use glass sparingly: header, KPI cards, drawers/modals.
- Dense surfaces (tables/forms) should be more opaque for readability.
- Ensure contrast meets accessibility (no low-contrast text on glass).
- Support dark mode with Tailwind dark: variants.

Component rules:
- Props must be typed.
- Keep components small and composable.
- Avoid prop drilling for app-wide state; propose a store only if needed (ask first).
